PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
quota:    Disk quota utilities.
quota:
quota:    Disk quota utilities, written by Marco van Wieringen, Edvard Tuinder,
quota:    and Linus Torvalds.  The required kernel patches are built into some
quota:    of the kernels and source provided with Slackware, and the patches can
quota:    be found in the ./kernel-source/v1.1 directory of the Slackware source
quota:    tree.
